view-if: not rb_explode
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources -= 1; left_strength += 5; left_dissent -= 3; rb_strength += 50; rb_militancy += 0.025; workers_egk += 2*(1-dissent); new_middle_egk += 1; radicalization += 1

Seydewitz supports building up the <span style="color: #30B24A;">Socialist</span> Youth, which attracts support to the Left and increases the militancy of the Reichsbanner.

@against_toleration
title: Against toleration
