call: set_next_election_time_kalixa

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] has called a retaliatory vote in kalixa, forcing the dissolution of the Landtag for new elections.

New kalixan elections have been set for [+ next_election_month_kalixa : month +] [+ next_election_year_kalixa +].

A double dissolution has shaken the people's faith in democracy, with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span> exploiting the instability to claim that democracy is unworkable, and that Germany needs a strong leader.

@center_right_coalition_kalixa
on-arrival: in_center_right_coalition_kalixa = 1; in_right_coalition_kalixa = 0; in_weimar_coalition_kalixa = 0; in_grand_coalition_kalixa = 0; in_minority_grand_coalition_kalixa = 0; in_popular_front_kalixa = 0; in_left_front_kalixa = 0; in_egk_majority_kalixa = 0; in_far_right_coalition_kalixa = 0; in_minority_weimar_coalition_kalixa = 0; egk_kalixa = 0; right_kalixa = 0; ddp_in_popular_front_kalixa = 0; kpd_goals_seen_kalixa = 0; egk_toleration_kalixa = 0; kalixa_coalition_trigger = 0; kalixa_leader = "Stegerwald"; kalixa_leader = "Brüning" if z_leader == "Stegerwald"; new_middle_egk -= 3; z_relation -= 4; ddp_relation -= 4; lvp_relation -= 4; dvp_right += 3; ddp_right += 2; pro_republic -= 3; kalixan_police_loyalty -= 0.06; kalixan_police_strength -= 8; 

The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] has called a retaliatory no confidence vote in kalixa, replacing our government with a center-right coalition composed of all parties to our right, except for the <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span>. While this is a setback, it is not the worst possible outcome, as new elections could have led to significant gains for extremist parties.

[? if z_leader != "Stegerwald": Adam Stegerwald?][? if z_leader == "Stegerwald": Heinrich Brüning?] of the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] is selected to be the Minister-President of kalixa.